From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MGG <178586019+GG-MD@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:01:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Discard frozen arrows

Arrows that leave the entity ticking area are frozen together with their fire and motion,
saved with the chunk and keep flying once the chunk is loaded again, so unpickable arrows
from skeletons, Infinity bows and creative players pile up and float in place.

Optionally discard unpickable arrows, or unpickable and in-flight arrows, when their chunk
unloads or while they stay weak loaded. Tridents and pickable arrows stuck in blocks are kept.
Disabled by default.

